    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memoria Altera is a narrative-driven puzzle game where you wake up on the floor suffering from amnesia. You must explore the futuristic lab you woke up in to recover your memories with the aid of a fellow amnesiac who is just as confused as you are. Venture deeper into the lab and unravel the secrets of who you were before losing your memories!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Key Features:</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4+ rooms to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7+ puzzles to solve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4+ cutscenes to experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of story rich dialogue to read</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 really cool follower to love</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memoria Altera is a narrative-driven puzzle game where you wake up on the floor suffering from amnesia. You must explore the futuristic lab you woke up in to recover your memories with the aid of a fellow amnesiac who is just as confused as you are. Venture deeper into the lab and unravel the secrets of who you were before losing your memories!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Key Features:</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4+ rooms to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7+ puzzles to solve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4+ cutscenes to experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of story rich dialogue to read</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 really cool follower to love</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Wake up in a dark, futuristic lab with no memories of who you are or why you're there. Explore the lab with your fellow amnesiac Lenny as you complete puzzles to unlock more of the facility and regain more memories of your past. Will you like who you turn out to be?",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
